Wait, but if they take 5 and go to 7, I'm threatening lethal next turn? My board: Soldier 4/5 vigilance, Mountain 5/5. Attack with both: 9 damage trampleless. They block... Hei Bai 7/7 blocks Mountain 5/5 (both... 5/5 vs 7/7: Mountain dies, Hei Bai takes 5 → 7/2 survives). Trebuchet blocks Soldier 4/5: 0/4 vs 4/5 — Trebuchet dies (4 ≥ 4), Soldier survives. Ally chumps nothing... So damage: 0? Soldier got blocked by Trebuchet. Hmm, 0 player damage. Ugh, no trample.\n\
