Hmm, what if instead of attacking, I hold back 5/5 Mountain AND 4/5 Soldier as blockers? Double-block Hei Bai 7/7: 5+4 = 9 ≥ 7 lethal, Hei Bai dies. Hei Bai assigns 7 damage: 5 to Mountain (lethal), 2 to Soldier (4/5 → 4/3 survives). So double block kills Hei Bai, I lose Mountain (returns tapped). That's a fine defensive play. But they see that and might not attack with Hei Bai, or sac to make it 9/9 (sac Clue + ... only one sac per trigger \"whenever enters or attacks, you may sacrifice another creature or artifact\" — one sac per attack → +2 counters → 7/7).\n\
