      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent's Hei Bai/Drill swing knocked me to 4 life; they're tapped out with Hei Bai 7/7, Trebuchet 0/4, and Ally tokens. I played my Forest and now attack with my 5/5 earthbent Mountain — it draws a card off Bitter Work, and if they block with the 0/4 Trebuchet it dies (double-blocking with the 1/1 loses both).",
