        "rationale": "Attacking with the 5/5 land creature triggers Bitter Work for a free card. Their only real blocker is the 0/4 Trebuchet, which dies to 5 damage; even a Temple pump leaves my Mountain alive. The land returns tapped if removed, so the risk is minimal.",
      },
