      "chosen_args": {
        "blockers": "p38:p15,p52:p66",
        "summary": "Opponent alpha-swung with Ally 2/2, Hei Bai 10/10 (trample), and the crewed Drill 6/3 (trample). I'm at 4 life with only two blockers (Badgermole 4/4, Forest 2/2) and 1 untapped land, so I can't activate my Food token. Every blocking line lets exactly 12 damage through — lethal no matter what. I'm blocking the Drill with Badgermole (kills it, 4 damage into 3 toughness) and Hei Bai with the Forest land (which returns tapped when it dies) to take down as much as possible.",
        "rationale": "All blocking configurations let exactly 12 trample/unblocked damage through against my 4 life, so the game is lost regardless. This line at least kills the Fire Nation Drill (Badgermole's 4 damage beats its 3 toughness) and chips Hei Bai for 2, maximizing damage dealt on the way out.",
      },
