The deck is heavily green with a light red splash (Iroh's Demonstration {1}{R}, Rough Rhino Cavalry {4}{R}, Bitter Work {1}{R}{G}, Bumi {3}{R}{G}, plus 2 Earth Rumble Wrestlers hybrid). Red sources needed: a few. Omashu City covers R/G. Rumble Arena can add any color for {1}.\n\
