Playing Omashu City and Rumble Arena seems good. Omashu City enters tapped but provides both colors. Rumble Arena enters untapped, taps for colorless, scry 1, and can fix any color.\n\
\n\
So: 17 lands total. If I play Omashu City + Rumble Arena, that's 2 pool lands, leaving 15 basics. Red sources: Omashu City (1), Rumble Arena (with activation), plus Mountains. With 4 red pips and red cards costing up to {4}{R}, we want maybe 3-4 red sources. Let's do 3 Mountains + Omashu City = 4 red sources (plus Rumble Arena as emergency). Forests: 12.\n\
\n\
So 12 Forest, 3 Mountain, Omashu City, Rumble Arena = 17.\n\
\n\
Alternatively 13 Forest, 2 Mountain + the two pool lands = 17. Red pips are only 4, and red spells are few. But red mana for casting Rough Rhino Cavalry on turn 5 and Iroh's Demonstration. Omashu City is a red source. 2 Mountains + Omashu = 3 red sources plus Rumble Arena. That might be a bit low but acceptable given green-heavy. Standard would be ~4 red sources for a splash. Let me go 3 Mountain, 12 Forest, Omashu City, Rumble Arena.\n\
